WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Corrosion. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Trace environment, material and protection

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Corrosion involves material, environment and electrochemical conditions. Coatings and design can reduce risk, not guarantee zero corrosion.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Map electrolyte, exposed surfaces and a possible galvanic couple; mark which details require material data.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Risk map

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Trace environment, material and protection
